<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Electricity Resistance</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 2
Class: Sorcerer (guild level 8), Conjurer (guild level 17, up to 80%)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast electricity resistance &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast electricity resistance</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Raises the target's electricity sphere for about ten minutes. Against a 
spell aimed at you, you defend with your brain and the better of its sphere 
or half your skill in that spell (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>), so the target resists 
electric spells better: jolt, electrical shock, lightning bolt, call 
lightning, lightning storm and lightning breath. The better your magic and 
your skill in the spell, the bigger the raise, up to ten points and a little 
more for a master.
</p><p>It doesn't add up: cast on someone who already has it, the magic just 
dissipates. You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on potions, 
wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Electricity Sphere</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Heat Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>